description: Bump application version and display it in the interface on every requested feature
alwaysApply: true
---

# Versioning Rules

- **Bump Version on Every Requested Feature**:
  - Whenever a new feature, improvement, or task requested by the user is implemented, increment the application version (e.g. semantic versioning: `0.1.0` -> `0.1.1` or `0.2.0`).
  - The source of truth for the version is in `app/version.py` (`__version__ = "X.Y.Z"`).
  - The version is served via `/api/version` and `/api/auth/status` and displayed in the UI (sidebar header badge, auth screen, boot screen).
  - Always keep `app/version.py` updated when completing any requested change.
